<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5426] Exporting the table structure API has regressed after the spark3 upgrade</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5426</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After Kylin upgraded Spark3, &lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableCommand&lt;/tt&gt; was changed to &lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableAsSerdeCommand&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableCommand&lt;/tt&gt; has been changed to &lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableAsSerdeCommand&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableAsSerdeCommand&lt;/tt&gt; can only generate DDLs for Hive serde tables, while &lt;tt&gt;ShowCreateTableCommand&lt;/tt&gt; shows the command that can be used to create the Spark DDL syntax for a given table, and for Hive serde tables, this command will generate Spark DDLs that can be be used to create the corresponding Spark table.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
